{"ts":"2026-09-09T13:56:09.443165293Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/desktop/mockups/ethos-desktop-mockup.html","new_string":"          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eThe ask\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prompt\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"prompt-head\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;font-size:8px\"\u003eCL\u003c/span\u003eclaude → bwk · \u003cspan class=\"mono\" style=\"color:var(--faint)\"\u003eprompt.md\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cp\u003eThe blame join — git blame to trailers to record.yaml to audit query — lives only inside the internal/ui browse handler. Extract it into \u003cb\u003eethos blame \u0026lt;file\u0026gt; --json\u003c/b\u003e so any client can front it. Preserve the per-SHA cache. The three attribution states must be distinct in the payload: a heuristic hit must never masquerade as authoritative — that was round 1's failure.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eWhat came back · round 2\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prompt back\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"prompt-head\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;font-size:8px\"\u003eBK\u003c/span\u003ebwk · \u003cspan class=\"chip pass\"\u003epass\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"conf\" style=\"margin-left:auto\"\u003econfidence 0.86\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cp\u003eJoin extracted into cmd/ethos/blame.go behind the shared data layer. Payload carries \u003cspan class=\"mono\"\u003eattribution: authoritative | heuristic | none\u003c/span\u003e per line; the ticket fallback is labeled and carries its matched token so a client can show its work. Round 1's mislabel is now structurally impossible — the two paths return different types.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eSuccess criteria\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:8px\"\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"crit\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tick\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003eethos blame \u0026lt;file\u0026gt; --json emits per-line attribution\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"crit\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tick\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003ethree attribution states distinguished in payload\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"crit\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"open\"\u003e○\u003c/span\u003emake check passes; commit per logical step\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e","old_string":"          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eContract\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cdl class=\"kv\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"\u003e\n              \u003cdt\u003eworker\u003c/dt\u003e\u003cdd\u003e\u003cspan class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;font-size:8px\"\u003eBK\u003c/span\u003e bwk · Go internals\u003c/dd\u003e\n              \u003cdt\u003eevaluator\u003c/dt\u003e\u003cdd\u003ersc \u003cspan class=\"chip mono\" title=\"pinned content hash\"\u003esha256 9f31…c2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/dd\u003e\n              \u003cdt\u003ewrite-set\u003c/dt\u003e\u003cdd class=\"mono\"\u003einternal/ui/** · cmd/ethos/blame.go\u003c/dd\u003e\n              \u003cdt\u003eticket\u003c/dt\u003e\u003cdd class=\"mono\"\u003eethos-b41k\u003c/dd\u003e\n              \u003cdt\u003ebudget\u003c/dt\u003e\u003cdd\u003e3 rounds · 2 used\u003c/dd\u003e\n            \u003c/dl\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eSuccess criteria\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:8px\"\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"crit\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tick\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003eethos blame \u0026lt;file\u0026gt; --json emits per-line attribution\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"crit\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"tick\"\u003e✓\u003c/span\u003ethree attribution states distinguished in payload\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"crit\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"open\"\u003e○\u003c/span\u003emake check passes; commit per logical step\u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\n            \u003ch3\u003eResults\u003c/h3\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px\"\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"round-block\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"head\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eRound 2\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip pass\"\u003epass\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"conf\"\u003econfidence 0.86\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\"\u003e2 files changed · +214 −61 · evidence: go test ✓, golden schema ✓\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003cdiv class=\"round-block\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"head\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eRound 1\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip fail\"\u003efail\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"conf\"\u003econfidence 0.71\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\"\u003eticket heuristic mislabeled as authoritative — reflected, re-scoped\u003c/div\u003e\n              \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"cb86612815c76336d21ed00f2e0437642877dd4f09fbc7bbb31114a1fe5ca8c4","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/desktop/mockups/ethos-desktop-mockup.html\",\"new_string\":\"          \\u003cdiv\\u003e\\n            \\u003ch3\\u003eThe ask\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n            \\u003cdiv class=\\\"promp..."}
