{"ts":"2026-09-09T13:56:58.916402287Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/desktop/mockups/ethos-desktop-mockup.html","new_string":"            \u003cdiv style=\"margin-top:4px\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip acc\"\u003eauthoritative\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","old_string":"            \u003cdiv style=\"margin-top:4px\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chip acc\"\u003eauthoritative\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"chip mono\"\u003ecommit 6ca6bd4\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"b8cdf667a8161351ae1979ca7b0bae2d50e9a696230f94029944b9b491f13250","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/desktop/mockups/ethos-desktop-mockup.html\",\"new_string\":\"            \\u003cdiv style=\\\"margin-top:4px\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan class=\\\"chip acc\\\"\\u003eauthoritative\\u003c/span\\..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-09T13:57:05.490573988Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md","new_string":"Interaction principles:\n\n- **Narrative first, mechanics on demand.** The most human artifacts in the\n  store — the verbatim spawn prompt (`prompt.md`), the result `prose`, the\n  success criterion a line of code served — lead every panel. Plumbing\n  (hashes, budgets, IDs, write-sets, evidence lists) recedes into a collapsed\n  \"Mechanics\" disclosure. A detail view that foregrounds `sha256 9f31…` over\n  \"what was asked and what came back\" has the hierarchy backwards.\n  (Operator-ruled on the v0 mockup, 2026-09-09.)\n- **Zero spinners.**","old_string":"Interaction principles:\n\n- **Zero spinners.**","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"ebaa1c589bbc9ad861a591f5a9da89d6e4a996b0bb9ac62f28f5c2ccc8e698ed","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md\",\"new_string\":\"Interaction principles:\\n\\n- **Narrative first, mechanics on demand.** The most human artifacts in the\\n  store — the verbatim spawn pro..."}
