{"ts":"2026-09-09T14:00:17.367934423Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md","new_string":"| Section | Shows | Backed by (exists today) |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Team** | Org chart from `reports_to`, identity cards, live session presence; identity detail: full personality/writing-style/talent content (the Library), role detail with safety constraints and anti-responsibilities, extensions (`.local` masked), generated-agent-file binding + staleness, resolution-provenance badge (repo / bundle / global) | identities/teams/roles/attribute stores; session roster; `--json` on identity/team/role/attribute commands |\n| **Missions** | Board keyed to the mission state machine; detail: the ask (`prompt.md`) and result prose first, criteria, per-round verdicts, `open_questions`, `artifacts/`, event timeline with corrections (a `fabrication` correction renders loud); pipeline lanes + template/archetype browser | `mission.Contract`, `Result`, events JSONL, `ShowPayload`/`LogPayload`/`ListEntry`, `ethos find missions`, pipeline/archetype seed content |\n| **Audit** | Session list → episode-grouped tool-call timeline; live tail streaming; sealed-vs-live boundary + chunk integrity strip; redacted lines shown as withheld; writes lens; out-of-write-set flags | Sealed chunks + live tail union; `hook.AuditView`; `QueryAuditByDelegation`; `audit.Classify` |\n| **Blame** | File tree + code view with a mission gutter; line → provenance panel; reverse view: a mission's commit footprint | `browse.go` blame join (to be extracted to CLI, § 6.3) |\n| **Decisions** | ADR list with lifecycle (proposed → settled → superseded), rejected alternatives, links to the missions where decided | `internal/adr` store, `ethos adr` CLI/MCP |\n| **Health** | Repo switcher, doctor as a status panel, enablement + hook currency, config view, `.vendor.yaml` provenance, active bundle | `ethos doctor`, `ethos.yaml`, vendor manifest |","old_string":"| Section | Shows | Backed by (exists today) |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Team** | Org chart from `reports_to`, identity cards (personality, talents, voice/email/GitHub bindings), live session presence | identities/teams/roles YAML; session roster; `--json` on identity/team/role commands |\n| **Missions** | Board keyed to the mission state machine; mission detail: contract, per-round results with verdict + confidence, event timeline, corrections; pipeline lanes | `mission.Contract`, `Result`, events JSONL, `ShowPayload`/`LogPayload`/`ListEntry`, `ethos find missions` |\n| **Audit** | Per-session tool-call timeline; sealed-vs-live boundary made visible; filter by delegation/tool | Sealed chunks + live tail union; `hook.AuditView`; `QueryAuditByDelegation` |\n| **Blame** | File tree + code view with a mission gutter; line → provenance panel; reverse view: a mission's commit footprint | `browse.go` blame join (to be extracted to CLI, § 6.3) |\n| **Health** | Repo switcher, doctor as a status panel, enablement state, config view | `ethos doctor`, `ethos.yaml` |","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"4657e633fc845865853e1a33bc9f2d0516b7be1d05aea1a8fc5bd11a28be784c","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md\",\"new_string\":\"| Section | Shows | Backed by (exists today) |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| **Team** | Org chart from `reports_to`, identity cards, live session pres..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-09T14:00:23.161296519Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md","new_string":"Plus the **coverage gate** (§ 4.2): a Go test walks the exported fields of\nevery GUI payload struct against `desktop/coverage.yaml` and fails on any\nfield with no declared screen — the `validate-content` pattern applied to the\nGUI surface.\n\nSuppression policy is the org's: none without operator approval; volume never\nchanges the rule.","old_string":"Suppression policy is the org's: none without operator approval; volume never\nchanges the rule.","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"b8c3f98b0821f636e85ad8ebc5ee89e2b2e6e06fc15b356b21901a6fa4562b4e","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md\",\"new_string\":\"Plus the **coverage gate** (§ 4.2): a Go test walks the exported fields of\\nevery GUI payload struct against `desktop/coverage.yaml` and ..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-09T14:00:36.154234776Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md","new_string":"## Appendix C — Data coverage matrix (v0)\n\nThe human-readable source for `desktop/coverage.yaml`. Prominence follows\n§ 4.5 (narrative first); coverage follows § 4.2 (everything lands).\n\n| Data | Home | Prominence |\n|---|---|---|\n| Identity core fields + bindings (email, github, voice, agent file) | Team · card + detail | primary |\n| Personality / writing-style / talent content (full markdown) | Team · Library reader | primary on detail |\n| Roles: tool restrictions, safety constraints, anti-responsibilities | Team · role view | primary on detail |\n| Teams: membership, collaboration edges, repos | Team · org chart + detail | primary |\n| Session roster (who is `iam`'d, where) | Team · presence | primary |\n| Resolution provenance (repo / bundle / global) + active bundle | Team badge · Health | secondary |\n| Extensions `\u003chandle\u003e.ext/\u003cns\u003e.yaml` (+ `.local` masked) | Team · identity detail | mechanics |\n| `.vendor.yaml` manifest | Health | mechanics |\n| Contract: ask, worker/evaluator, criteria, status, rounds | Missions · detail | primary |\n| Contract: write-set, ticket, budget, tools, hashes | Missions · mechanics | mechanics |\n| Contract: `depends_on`, `preconditions`, `extract_into`, `write_set_released_at` | Missions · mechanics + board arrows | mechanics |\n| Result: prose, verdict, confidence, `open_questions` | Missions · detail | primary |\n| Result: `files_changed`, `evidence` | Missions · mechanics | mechanics |\n| Events + corrections (kind, claim, corrected, supersedes) | Missions · timeline; `fabrication` renders loud | primary |\n| Delegation record (tier, spawn_pattern, parent chain, prompt_hash) | Missions/Audit · mechanics | mechanics |\n| `prompt.md` (the ask, verbatim) | Missions detail · Blame provenance | primary |\n| `artifacts/` | Missions · detail | secondary |\n| `missions.jsonl` trace (∪ open-mission dir scan) | Missions · board + history | primary |\n| Audit entries (all fields incl. `redacted`, previews, hashes) | Audit · episodes → entries → raw | primary/mechanics |\n| Live tail vs sealed chunks; `audit.Classify` states; watermark | Audit · seal boundary + integrity strip | primary |\n| Blame joins: trailers, ticket heuristic, three states | Blame | primary |\n| ADRs (lifecycle, alternatives, mission links) | Decisions | primary |\n| Pipeline templates + instantiations; archetypes | Missions · lanes + browser | secondary |\n| Doctor checks, enablement markers, hook currency | Health | primary |\n| Generated `.claude/agents/*.md` + staleness | Team · bindings | secondary |\n| Write-set conflicts, staleness, evaluator-hash breakdowns | Missions board flags · spawn-refusal explainer | secondary |\n\n## Appendix B — Sources","old_string":"## Appendix B — Sources","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"b4bbf91230beccd3c3d11e4f6002a57879677f06e471388b4bc3e7b47b0a6079","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/desktop/PLAN.md\",\"new_string\":\"## Appendix C — Data coverage matrix (v0)\\n\\nThe human-readable source for `desktop/coverage.yaml`. Prominence follows\\n§ 4.5 (narrativ..."}
