{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:09:01.758465618Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker bwk --evaluator rsc --write-set \"spike/deskd/**\" --criteria \"Go bridge daemon (stdlib only) serving this repo's sibling ethos repo mission data over localhost HTTP+JSON: GET /api/missions (union of 'ethos find missions --format json' closed JSONL and 'ethos mission list --json --status all', normalize id/mission_id mismatch), GET /api/missions/{id} ('mission show --json' + 'mission log --json' + FS reads of delegations/*/prompt.md and artifacts/ listing), GET /api/identities, GET /api/session. Bearer token auth; CORS: Allow-Origin *, Allow-Headers authorization+content-type, OPTIONS 204. First stdout line {\\\"port\\\":N,\\\"token\\\":\\\"...\\\"}. Per-request latency log line (endpoint, CLI cmds, ms). Assert ethos version at startup. gofmt+go vet clean. Commit incrementally, one commit per logical step, max 30min uncommitted.\"","description":"Dispatch M1 daemon mission (bwk/rsc)"},"tool_input_hash":"774c7f354ae5e479e3e3faeb96f94afdcc6a749084b077adb23cfeadd8456029","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker bwk --evaluator rsc --write-set \\\"spike/deskd/**\\\" --criteria \\\"Go bridge daemon (stdlib only) serving this repo's s..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:09:09.383937779Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker adb --evaluator kth --write-set \"apps/desk/**\" --write-set \"tools/shot/**\" --write-set \"Makefile\" --write-set \".gitignore\" --criteria \"Tauri 2 shell + screenshot rig. Scaffold: pnpm create tauri-app desk --template react-ts --manager pnpm under apps/ (Vite:1420). pnpm tauri add shell. Build sibling spike/deskd to src-tauri/binaries/deskd-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu (must exist before tauri dev; wire beforeDevCommand). Capability shell:allow-execute sidecar:true. In .setup() spawn sidecar, parse first stdout line into managed state, expose #[tauri::command] daemon_info (no emit-from-setup). Commit scaffolded src/ as generated then do not touch it (another mission owns it). Makefile: make dev (pnpm tauri dev), make shot SCREEN=\u003croute\u003e (boot deskd + pnpm dev + playwright screenshot to .tmp/shots/, reuse chromium at ethos/.tmp/shotkit). Commit incrementally, one commit per logical step, max 30min uncommitted.\"","description":"Dispatch M2 shell+shot mission (adb/kth)"},"tool_input_hash":"3106218a2629feec6f4fc16cd8fbd70e304b849b20eaa16f437f445bfbad86e8","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker adb --evaluator kth --write-set \\\"apps/desk/**\\\" --write-set \\\"tools/shot/**\\\" --write-set \\\"Makefile\\\" --write-set ..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:09:21.693773962Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker edt --evaluator dna --write-set \"spike/ui/**\" --criteria \"Missions UI kit, fixture-driven, in a plain Vite React-TS sandbox at spike/ui (pnpm create vite). Step 1: capture real fixture JSON by running (read-only) in ../ethos: ethos find missions --format json; ethos mission list --json --status all; ethos mission show \u003c3 diverse ids\u003e --json; ethos mission log \u003csame\u003e --json; plus copy 2 real delegations prompt.md files; save under spike/ui/fixtures/. Build the Linear-pattern Missions screen per the visual spec at mockups/ethos-desktop-mockup.html: grouped dense list with status glyphs, side peek panel. Progressive disclosure, 3 levels: L1 row; L2 peek narrative (the ask from prompt.md, result prose, criteria, coarse timeline - only 2-3 events per mission, do not fake granularity); L3 collapsed Mechanics details (hashes, budget, write-set, ids). Established patterns only (Linear master-detail, NN/g progressive disclosure) - no invented idioms. Tailwind v4. Handle missing/empty fields visibly. Screenshot evidence in the mission result (playwright vs vite dev, chromium at ../ethos/.tmp/shotkit). Commit incrementally, one commit per logical step, max 30min uncommitted.\"","description":"Dispatch M3 UI-kit mission (edt/dna)"},"tool_input_hash":"73ddc4e452eded37cc9dce2ec853374587900d2112df439dced0d2239a25e0aa","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker edt --evaluator dna --write-set \\\"spike/ui/**\\\" --criteria \\\"Missions UI kit, fixture-driven, in a plain Vite React-..."}
