{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:11:25.9071845Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-shell-8a310d7b0a566aee","agent_type":"worker-shell","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Mission m-2026-09-11-006 contract's write_set is …","message":"Mission m-2026-09-11-006 contract's write_set is just [.gitignore] — doesn't cover apps/desk/**, Makefile, tools/shot/**, docs that this mission needs to create. Per DES-069, write_set is only mechanically enforced for verifier spawns (Write/Edit), not for me as worker, so I'm proceeding with the full scope as instructed rather than blocking on it. Flagging so you can correct the contract for audit accuracy, or let me know if you want me to pause instead.","recipient":"main","summary":"mission 006 write_set is only .gitignore — flagging, proceeding anyway","to":"main","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"984c6a1e2872c5f870f7c37631efc3eb39a69ccd22af2703cbd65eee7bd2ac69","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Mission m-2026-09-11-006 contract's write_set is …\",\"message\":\"Mission m-2026-09-11-006 contract's write_set is just [.gitignore] — doesn't cover apps/desk/**, Makefile, tools/shot/**,..."}
