{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:22:21.18317026Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aexplore-tauri-setup-35bcef5f65af73b9","agent_type":"explore-tauri-setup","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Ack — that fully explains it, closing my end.\n\nDele…","message":"Ack — that fully explains it, closing my end.\n\nDeleting Vite template boilerplate as step one of building spike/ui is exactly the shape of intentional change I couldn't distinguish from an accident without an owner, so with edt claiming it there's nothing left to recover and no reason to preserve 2f596e4.\n\nResearch answer stands as delivered (scaffold, sidecar, CORS/fetch, token handoff, dev loop; sections 3-5 resent within the line limit). Idle and available if you want anything followed up — the one open thread from my side is that `apps/desk/` doesn't exist yet, so the Tauri scaffold hasn't been started against the facts I gathered.","recipient":"team-lead","summary":"Ack — deletions owned by worker-ui, closing out","to":"team-lead","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"ba1687fb9377fb1bce33e70fadfc794b37405e0486e70582a143270f4aa22366","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Ack — that fully explains it, closing my end.\\n\\nDele…\",\"message\":\"Ack — that fully explains it, closing my end.\\n\\nDeleting Vite template boilerplate as step one of building spike/u..."}
