{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:38:30.588611287Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/fixtures/README.md","new_string":"- **`m-2026-07-21-001`** — 3-round pass, rich per-round reflection prose,\n  a captured `prompt.md`, and real structured `open_questions` on every\n  round (see finding 5 — pulled from the raw `results.yaml` because\n  `mission show --json` drops the field).","old_string":"- **`m-2026-07-21-001`** — 3-round pass, rich per-round reflection prose\n  including a genuine deferred-scope (\"open question\") passage in round 1.\n  Has a captured `prompt.md`.","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"1230d9023c94addf443618a1ce6f5f4eb82132ca1b12431aabcfa1dd3a5c6ca3","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/fixtures/README.md\",\"new_string\":\"- **`m-2026-07-21-001`** — 3-round pass, rich per-round reflection prose,\\n  a captured `prompt.md`, and real structu..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:38:40.881160087Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/fixtures/README.md","new_string":"5. **`ethos mission show --json` silently drops the `open_questions`\n   field.** It's a real, documented part of the `ethos mission result`\n   YAML schema (`ethos mission result --help` shows it in the escalate\n   example) and every round of `m-2026-07-21-001`'s raw `results.yaml`\n   has one or two entries — but the JSON `show` prints for that same\n   mission omits the field entirely. The UI reads the raw YAML directly\n   for this one mission (via the `yaml` package, `?raw` import) to\n   render the \"Open questions for the leader\" callout honestly; every\n   other mission's peek panel has no open-questions section because no\n   other mission had its raw YAML fetched, not because the field is\n   rare in the real data — grep'd, `open_questions:` appears in 28 of the\n   135 local `results.yaml` files. This CLI gap should be fixed before\n   any production read path is built on `mission show --json` alone.\n6. **No mission in the local store has a fail-then-pass round history.**\n   Every multi-round mission that ultimately closed as `pass` also\n   passed on every individual round (the failures live inside per-round\n   *evidence* items and open questions, not the round verdict). The\n   fixture set does not fabricate one to fit the ask.","old_string":"5. **No mission in the local store has a fail-then-pass round history**\n   or a structured \"open questions\" field. Deferred/open-question content\n   exists only as prose inside reflection/result text — the mission\n   contract asked for one example of each; the closest honest substitutes\n   are documented above rather than fabricated to fit the ask.","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"185a23425e172c8f88dfb189d3df89a81a8c9b62f1e22e1742e50033644b8d48","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/fixtures/README.md\",\"new_string\":\"5. **`ethos mission show --json` silently drops the `open_questions`\\n   field.** It's a real, documented part of the `..."}
