{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:38:57.434102735Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"$(cat \u003c\u003c'EOF'\nspike/ui: surface real open_questions, discovered missing from show --json\n\nThe contract asked for a mission with open_questions as one of the\nthree diverse fixtures. `ethos mission show --json` never surfaces\nthat field even though it's a documented part of the `mission result`\nYAML schema and 28 of 135 local results.yaml files have it. Rather\nthan fabricate the field, fetch it from the one real place it exists\n(m-2026-07-21-001's raw results.yaml, parsed client-side with `yaml`)\nand render it as a distinct \"Open questions for the leader\" callout in\nthe peek panel's result card. Documented as a CLI gap in fixtures/README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 \[REDACTED:email]\u003e\nEOF\n)\" -- spike/ui","description":"Commit open_questions feature"},"tool_input_hash":"17bfafda0d2ad051d49e3c14be79af4981b12577dfdf8afbc4b41c2a12000b23","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 git commit -m \\\"$(cat \\u003c\\u003c'EOF'\\nspike/ui: surface real open_questions, discovered missing from show --json\\n\\nThe contract asked for a miss..."}
