{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:39:50.972497771Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"rm -f ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/result-m-2026-09-11-007.yaml \u0026\u0026 cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git status --short","description":"Clean scratch file and check final git status"},"tool_input_hash":"251032f1421b7802d7e9d754ff16702de885d4160b24b16293fa51eeac1214d3","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"rm -f ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/result-m-2026-09-11-007.yaml \\u0026\\u0026 cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 git status --short\",\"description\":\"Clean scratch file and check final g..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T04:40:10.103790065Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Mission m-2026-09-11-007 round 1: verdict pass, c…","message":"Mission m-2026-09-11-007 round 1: verdict pass, confidence 0.85, result submitted via `ethos mission result`.\n\nBuilt at ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui — plain Vite + React 19 + TS + Tailwind v4, fixture-driven, zero daemon dependency. 4 commits on spike/thin-slice (02f63f4 scaffold+fixtures, 10f259e screen implementation, 995e7ff keyboard-nav/polish, 988c1c2 open_questions). tsc --noEmit clean throughout.\n\nFixtures (spike/ui/fixtures/, documented in fixtures/README.md) are 100% real, read-only ethos CLI output: full `find missions`/`mission list` JSON from the ethos repo (156 unique missions after dedup), show+log for 3 diverse missions, 2 real prompt.md files, and — after finding a CLI gap — the raw results.yaml for the multi-round mission.\n\nScreens: Linear-pattern grouped dense list (status glyph, mono short-id, headline, round/verdict badges, avatar) + side peek panel, 3-level progressive disclosure exactly per contract. j/k+Enter nav and a real substring search both work. Screenshot loop against the mockup (spike/ui/shots/final-00 through final-08, 9 images) ran 4+ rounds — read each PNG, fixed real bugs: date-column AM/PM wrap, sha256 hash overflow in Mechanics, headline mid-word truncation, an \"escalate\" verdict wrongly styled red.\n\nDesign findings from working the real data (full detail in fixtures/README.md):\n1. No title field exists anywhere in the mission data model — headline is derived (success_criteria[0], sentence-boundary heuristic for run-on paragraphs, honest \"(no description recorded)\" fallback).\n2. `ethos find missions` and `ethos mission list` return different, only ~75%-overlapping id sets from the same store. UI unions both and visibly marks list-only rows as \"thin\" — 51 real cases exercised this.\n3. success_criteria has no per-item done/not-done flag; only round `evidence[]` does, and it isn't index-aligned to criteria. Criteria render as plain bullets, not checkboxes, to avoid misrepresenting the data.\n4. Round verdict has four real values — pass/fail/escalate/abandoned — not two. escalate is amber, not red.\n5. Biggest find: **`ethos mission show --json` silently drops `open_questions`**, a real documented field on the result schema present in 28/135 local results.yaml files. Had to parse the raw YAML client-side to render it honestly. Recommend fixing this before any production read path relies on `show --json` alone.\n6. No mission in the local store has a fail-then-pass round history — didn't fabricate one to fit the ask.\n\nRelevant paths: ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/src/components/PeekPanel.tsx, ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/src/lib/grouping.ts, ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/src/data/fixtures.ts, ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/fixtures/README.md, ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/ui/shots/","recipient":"team-lead","summary":"Missions UI kit built, verdict pass, result submitted","to":"team-lead","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"218b3b19940954ab9ee1621ef5fde48a81f07bb483ed2021d45f833e7eb4efe1","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Mission m-2026-09-11-007 round 1: verdict pass, c…\",\"message\":\"Mission m-2026-09-11-007 round 1: verdict pass, confidence 0.85, result submitted via `ethos mission result`.\\n\\nBuilt at ~..."}
