{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:06:11.044366468Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"You're up again — new mission m-2026-09-11-011 (i…","message":"You're up again — new mission m-2026-09-11-011 (integration), building directly on your m-007 work. cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk (branch spike/thin-slice) and run `ethos mission show m-2026-09-11-011` for the contract.\n\nTask: port your spike/ui Missions screen into apps/desk/src/ (the Tauri app scaffolded by another worker — do NOT touch apps/desk/src-tauri or spike/). Replace fixture loading with a live daemon client:\n- isTauri guard: `typeof window !== 'undefined' \u0026\u0026 '__TAURI_INTERNALS__' in window`; when true, dynamic-import @tauri-apps/api/core and invoke('daemon_info') (retry a few hundred ms) for {port, token}; when false (browser/Playwright), read import.meta.env.VITE_DESKD_URL and VITE_DESKD_TOKEN.\n- fetch GET /api/missions and /api/missions/{id} with header Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e. The daemon is spike/deskd (run: `go run ./spike/deskd --repo ../ethos`, first stdout line is {\"port\":N,\"token\":\"...\"}). /api/missions returns the merged 155-mission list (the union logic you built client-side in m-007 now lives server-side — delete your client version); /api/missions/{id} returns show+log+delegation prompt_md+artifacts. Inspect the actual JSON with curl first and adapt your types; where the API is missing something your UI renders from fixtures (e.g. open_questions, which show --json drops), render the honest 'not recorded' state and NOTE THE GAP in your result — do not parse ethos YAML from the frontend.\n- Verify with the existing rig: `make shot SCREEN=/` (browser mode; ~50% flaky due to host lock contention — just retry). Read the PNG, iterate, include final shots in your result.\n- tsc --noEmit clean; commit per logical step. Submit `ethos mission result` when done (your write_set is apps/desk/src/** — all your changed files must be under it) and report back.","recipient":"worker-ui","summary":"M4 integration mission — you're up again","to":"worker-ui","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"edf8f4509c77c2bf35e53d745e69ec81738c1671b6a45bd1f0736b97488a5649","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"You're up again — new mission m-2026-09-11-011 (i…\",\"message\":\"You're up again — new mission m-2026-09-11-011 (integration), building directly on your m-007 work. cd ~/Coding/punt-la..."}
