{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:25:39.706237336Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"rm -f ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/result-m-2026-09-11-011.yaml ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd-inspect ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd-inspect.out ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd-inspect.err ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/probe*.mjs ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd2.* ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/vite2.log\ncd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git status --short apps/desk/src","description":"Clean up scratch files and do a final status check"},"tool_input_hash":"d688d978ed14cb8b2d3da2a6fbaccf4b8667d466f4af898f0503a8c51ea5ac2c","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"rm -f ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/result-m-2026-09-11-011.yaml ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd-inspect ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd-inspect.out ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/.tmp/deskd..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:25:49.411315653Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git log --oneline -3 -- apps/desk/src","description":"Confirm final commit history for apps/desk/src"},"tool_input_hash":"2862ef7341a680b4324d8c4b74259510cb8b27fff3467b4eab9ce23af0387ad7","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 git log --oneline -3 -- apps/desk/src\",\"description\":\"Confirm final commit history for apps/desk/src\"}"}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:26:06.686796927Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Mission m-2026-09-11-011 round 1: verdict pass, c…","message":"Mission m-2026-09-11-011 round 1: verdict pass, confidence 0.85, result submitted. All work in one commit, bffb8cf, strictly under apps/desk/src/**. tsc --noEmit clean.\n\nPorted the spike/ui Missions screen into apps/desk/src/ with a real deskd client (isTauri guard -\u003e daemon_info poll, browser fallback -\u003e VITE_DESKD_URL/TOKEN, bearer auth on every /api/ call, per-id detail cache). Tailwind became hand-written plain CSS since adding a build plugin would've required editing vite.config.ts/package.json, outside my write set. All 155 real missions render; peek panel lazy-loads full detail (prompt excerpts, result prose, evidence, criteria, timeline, Mechanics).\n\nTwo things worth your attention:\n\n1. **Correction to my own m-007 finding.** I claimed `ethos mission show --json` drops `open_questions`. That was wrong — verified live here and by re-grepping my own m-007 fixture file, which had it all along. I just missed the key when inspecting it back then. spike/ui still carries an unneeded yaml-parsing workaround and an incorrect README claim for this; I can't fix it (outside m-011's write set) but wanted to flag it since someone should clean that up. Full writeup in apps/desk/src/API-NOTES.md.\n\n2. **tools/shot/shot.sh has a real timing gap**, not just the documented lock-contention flake. `npx playwright screenshot` there has no --wait-for-selector, so it screenshots on the page's `load` event — before any deskd-backed app's post-mount fetch resolves. My official `make shot SCREEN=/` run (2 attempts, 2nd succeeded) shows the shell rendering correctly but the missions pane stuck on \"Connecting to deskd…\". I proved the code itself is correct with a manual instance + `--wait-for-selector=\".mission-row\"`, which shows all 155 missions with full real detail (screenshots at apps/desk/.tmp/shots/manual-01 through 05, not committed — outside write set). Recommend adding a wait-for-selector to shot.sh before trusting it for any deskd-backed screen.\n\nAlso found live: GET /api/missions has no description field at all (no success_criteria/context/title) — real API constraint, not a client gap. Row headline honestly falls back to type+ticket.\n\nRelevant paths: apps/desk/src/lib/daemon.ts, apps/desk/src/lib/api.ts, apps/desk/src/components/PeekPanel.tsx, apps/desk/src/API-NOTES.md, apps/desk/.tmp/shots/ (screenshots, local only).","recipient":"team-lead","summary":"M4 integration mission complete, verdict pass","to":"team-lead","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"16e8ac0fb76d7abde0fca824dbb1c5b0c06e886146b8358c5dac22de4ac09464","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Mission m-2026-09-11-011 round 1: verdict pass, c…\",\"message\":\"Mission m-2026-09-11-011 round 1: verdict pass, confidence 0.85, result submitted. All work in one commit, bffb8cf, strictl..."}
