{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:26:51.781036066Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-deskd-8cc8192e6dcc72db","agent_type":"worker-deskd","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/deskd/missions.go","new_string":"type traceSummary struct {\n\tID              string   `json:\"id\"`\n\tCreatedAt       string   `json:\"created_at\"`\n\tClosedAt        string   `json:\"closed_at\"`\n\tStatus          string   `json:\"status\"`\n\tType            string   `json:\"type\"`\n\tLeader          string   `json:\"leader\"`\n\tWorker          string   `json:\"worker\"`\n\tEvaluator       string   `json:\"evaluator\"`\n\tTicket          string   `json:\"ticket\"`\n\tVerdict         string   `json:\"verdict\"`\n\tSuccessCriteria []string `json:\"success_criteria\"`\n}","old_string":"type traceSummary struct {\n\tID        string `json:\"id\"`\n\tCreatedAt string `json:\"created_at\"`\n\tClosedAt  string `json:\"closed_at\"`\n\tStatus    string `json:\"status\"`\n\tType      string `json:\"type\"`\n\tLeader    string `json:\"leader\"`\n\tWorker    string `json:\"worker\"`\n\tEvaluator string `json:\"evaluator\"`\n\tTicket    string `json:\"ticket\"`\n\tVerdict   string `json:\"verdict\"`\n}","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"fa02dddc01d2677f86b340cb75fe616657d221bacb1bc5e823da71ccbe0c2bdf","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/spike/deskd/missions.go\",\"new_string\":\"type traceSummary struct {\\n\\tID              string   `json:\\\"id\\\"`\\n\\tCreatedAt       string   `json:\\\"created_at\\\"`\\n\\tC..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:26:55.386653689Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Agent","tool_input":{"description":"Review spike branch: code quality","name":"review-code","prompt":"Review the spike branch at ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk (branch spike/thin-slice, the whole repo is new — review all committed code: spike/deskd/ Go daemon, apps/desk/ Tauri+React app, spike/ui/ fixture sandbox, tools/, Makefile). READ-ONLY — report findings, change nothing.\n\nCalibration: this is explicitly spike-grade code validating a design in one day, not production. Do NOT report style nits, missing tests, or hardening that production would need — those are known and accepted. DO report, with file:line and severity:\n1. Correctness bugs on the demo path (daemon merge/union logic, auth/CORS middleware, the daemon_info handoff, the UI's data handling of the 155 real missions).\n2. Anything that would make the spike's FINDINGS wrong (mislabeled data, silent fallbacks that fake success).\n3. Security issues in the localhost surface beyond the accepted spike posture (accepted: CORS *, bearer token, loopback bind; NOT accepted: token leakage into logs/screenshots, command injection via URL params into the ethos CLI exec, path traversal in FS reads of prompt.md/artifacts).\n\nOutput: findings list ranked by severity, each with file:line, one-line failure scenario, and suggested fix. If clean in a category, say so explicitly.","subagent_type":"code-reviewer"},"tool_input_hash":"da6818b844315c6e968f3979a4a7b44f2336e12eb7e85c3dec3e3eafd20c5a64","tool_input_preview":"{\"description\":\"Review spike branch: code quality\",\"name\":\"review-code\",\"prompt\":\"Review the spike branch at ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk (branch spike/thin-slice, the whole repo is new — review all comm..."}
