{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:30:04.906744603Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Silent-failure review findings for you, fold into…","message":"Silent-failure review findings for you, fold into one commit under spike/deskd/: (HIGH) identity.go:27-32 — /api/session collapses real exec failures and the benign no-session case into one silent empty roster; when err != nil, note \"session_err=\u003cerr\u003e\" in the latency log line, when only !json.Valid note \"session=no-active-session\"; keep returning the empty roster either way. (LOW) missions.go:115-118 — mission-show failures all map to 404; return 500 unless the error text indicates not-found. (LOW) identity.go:10-15 — add the same json.Valid guard to /api/identities so prose stdout can't ship as application/json (500 + logged note on invalid). Optional trivial: fs.go excerpt() byte-500 cut can split a UTF-8 rune — cut on a rune boundary. gofmt/vet, one commit, reply done.","recipient":"worker-deskd","summary":"Review fixes: session error logging + 2 lows","to":"worker-deskd","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"6a384714ab9373dbfdeb9633c1768592091a005fa33c8b6e7d0cc6ff783a61df","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Silent-failure review findings for you, fold into…\",\"message\":\"Silent-failure review findings for you, fold into one commit under spike/deskd/: (HIGH) identity.go:27-32 — /api/session ..."}
