{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:30:08.36484344Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-shell-8a310d7b0a566aee","agent_type":"worker-shell","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Done — commit d9d8d65 on spike/thin-slice, tools/…","message":"Done — commit d9d8d65 on spike/thin-slice, tools/shot/shot.sh only.\n\nAdded --wait-for-selector to the playwright screenshot call (default .mission-row, overridable via WAIT_FOR env var, WAIT_TIMEOUT_MS default 15000), with a fallback to an unconditional screenshot if the selector never appears so non-deskd screens still shoot.\n\nVerified with make shot SCREEN=/ (took 3 attempts — first hit the known ethos-session-lock deskd flake, second hit vite EMFILE under concurrent agent load, third succeeded). Confirmed by viewing the PNG directly: apps/desk/.tmp/shots/root.png now shows the real Missions list (129 closed missions, detail pane with the Bugbot finding on internal/hook/format_output.go) — not the \"Connecting to deskd…\" placeholder.","recipient":"main","summary":"done: shot.sh wait-for-selector fix, PNG confirmed showing mission rows","to":"main","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"2f9d680d676dd8271bdc2865c3718f54c814bc66996982971bc1d9854c556ea4","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Done — commit d9d8d65 on spike/thin-slice, tools/…\",\"message\":\"Done — commit d9d8d65 on spike/thin-slice, tools/shot/shot.sh only.\\n\\nAdded --wait-for-selector to the playwright scre..."}
