{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:32:23.358239943Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-deskd-8cc8192e6dcc72db","agent_type":"worker-deskd","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"$(cat \u003c\u003c'EOF'\nspike(deskd): fix silent-failure review findings\n\n- /api/session: log session_err=\u003cerr\u003e for a real exec failure vs.\n  session=no-active-session for the benign no-JSON case, instead of\n  collapsing both into one silent empty roster.\n- /api/missions/{id}: mission-show failures only map to 404 when the\n  CLI's own error names a missing mission; anything else is 500.\n- /api/identities: same json.Valid guard as /api/session, so non-JSON\n  stdout can't ship as an application/json body.\n- fs.go excerpt(): cut on a rune boundary, not a byte offset, so a\n  multi-byte UTF-8 rune in a prompt can't be split.\nEOF\n)\" -- spike/deskd/fs.go spike/deskd/identity.go spike/deskd/missions.go","description":"Commit the review-finding fixes"},"tool_input_hash":"ce4437cb0d13629ad35e1d7fe5d7ac38223915123feee070bc0527ce52bcfeda","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 git commit -m \\\"$(cat \\u003c\\u003c'EOF'\\nspike(deskd): fix silent-failure review findings\\n\\n- /api/session: log session_err=\\u003cerr\\u003e for a r..."}
