{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:49:58.30424281Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git add apps/desk/src \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"$(cat \u003c\u003c'EOF'\napps/desk/src: handle deskd's trace_only rows and new list envelope\n\nTwo deskd changes landed since the last integration pass, both handled:\n\n- Commit b655eed: 30 of 155 ids exist only in the find-missions trace\n  log (store directory gone); GET /api/missions marks them\n  trace_only:true and GET /api/missions/{id} 200s with that same trace\n  summary instead of 404ing. useMissionDetail() now takes the row (not\n  just its id) and skips the detail fetch entirely for a trace-only\n  row — there's nothing behind it to fetch, it would just echo back\n  what the row already has. PeekPanel renders an honest \"trace-log\n  record only — full mission record no longer in the store\" state for\n  the ask/result sections, a \"trace-log only\" badge, and a \"TRACE\" tag\n  on the row; success criteria still render since deskd's trace summary\n  carries success_criteria directly (verified live: 30/30 trace-only\n  rows have it).\n\n- Commit fb6bf8c: GET /api/missions became {missions, degraded} instead\n  of a bare array (breaking). fetchMissions()/App.tsx/Sidebar.tsx\n  updated to the envelope; a non-empty `degraded` (ids whose\n  enrichment failed) now surfaces as a visible sidebar note instead of\n  silently vanishing from the list. Empty in every live check so far.\n\nVerified live against a rebuilt deskd: 155 missions, 30 trace-only,\nenvelope parses correctly, and a trace-only mission's peek panel shows\nthe new honest state end-to-end (screenshot reviewed).\n\ntsc --noEmit clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 \[REDACTED:email]\u003e\nEOF\n)\" -- apps/desk/src","description":"Commit apps/desk trace-only and envelope handling"},"tool_input_hash":"f000d7418a8e97efec606a582d30920cbffdeab7418b7445164ffe488ee64441","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 git add apps/desk/src \\u0026\\u0026 git commit -m \\\"$(cat \\u003c\\u003c'EOF'\\napps/desk/src: handle deskd's trace_only rows and new list envelope\\n\\nT..."}
{"ts":"2026-09-11T05:50:11.149726892Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","agent_id":"aworker-ui-85a325c3a077a9d5","agent_type":"worker-ui","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 git add spike/ui/src/data/fixtures.ts spike/ui/package.json spike/ui/pnpm-lock.yaml spike/ui/fixtures/README.md spike/ui/shots/verify-open-questions-post-yaml-removal.png \u0026\u0026 git commit -m \"$(cat \u003c\u003c'EOF'\nspike/ui: remove the unneeded yaml workaround, fix README counts\n\nopen_questions is a real field directly on `mission show --json`'s\nresults — the m-007 claim that it was dropped was wrong (corrected in\na prior commit's README text but the workaround code was left in\nplace). Removes the raw-YAML splice: the `yaml` package import, the\nRawResultRecord type, loadOpenQuestionsByRound(), and the per-mission\nclone-and-splice in loadMissionRows() — `row.full = fixture.show` is\nenough, open_questions rides along with every other result field.\nDropped the now-unused `yaml` devDependency.\n\nAlso fixes a stale count in fixtures/README.md finding 2: the trace\nlog's 105 lines include one duplicate (m-2026-07-26-013 appears\ntwice), so it's 104 unique ids vs mission-list's 125, not 105 vs 125.\n\nVerified: tsc --noEmit clean, and a screenshot of the running app\n(shots/verify-open-questions-post-yaml-removal.png) confirms\nopen_questions still renders identically for m-2026-07-21-001 with the\nworkaround gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 \[REDACTED:email]\u003e\nEOF\n)\" -- spike/ui/src/data/fixtures.ts spike/ui/package.json spike/ui/pnpm-lock.yaml spike/ui/fixtures/README.md spike/ui/shots/verify-open-questions-post-yaml-removal.png","description":"Commit spike/ui yaml removal and README corrections"},"tool_input_hash":"f31ada304792b56768d5d3c137caceb0f52526faaf53b539aa076088e2f80776","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 git add spike/ui/src/data/fixtures.ts spike/ui/package.json spike/ui/pnpm-lock.yaml spike/ui/fixtures/README.md spike/ui/shots/verify-open-questions..."}
