{"ts":"2026-09-11T13:24:08.324306641Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Write","tool_input":{"content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003ctitle\u003eUX teardown — references vs desk\u003c/title\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n  body { background:#0d1013; color:#e8eaed; font:14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:32px 40px 80px; }\n  h1 { font-size:18px; } h2 { font-size:15px; margin:48px 0 6px; color:#9aa3ad; }\n  p.cap { margin:0 0 12px; color:#7c8590; max-width:900px; }\n  img { max-width:100%; border:1px solid #2a3138; border-radius:8px; display:block; }\n  .pair { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; }\n  .tag { font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6f7883; }\n\u003c/style\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003eUX teardown — real product references vs what we shipped\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eDelta numbers refer to desk/docs/ux-teardown-2026-09-11.md.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e1 · Linear — real issues list (from their docs)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eRow anatomy: priority glyph · status circle · muted id · plain-weight title · 0–3 tiny chips · muted date · avatar. Filter left, Display right, view pills, group headers with counts. → D1 D2 D4 D5 D6\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-docs-concepts.png\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e2 · Linear — real issue detail (homepage app frame)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eOne dominant title, description prose, compact activity feed — and ALL metadata in the quiet right properties rail. → D3\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-home.png\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e3 · Linear — issue composer (docs)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eTitle → description → properties as small pills at the bottom. Metadata never competes with the narrative. → D3 D5\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-docs-issue.png\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e4 · Notion — the other school\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eSoft color pills, white cards, friendly. Named so the school choice is explicit. → D7\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"notion-viewport.png\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e5 · GitHub — real blame view\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eAge heat-strip; attribution in commit-spanning bands, not per-line labels. → D9\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"github-blame.png\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003e6 · What we shipped (running app, live data)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003e6–7 equal-weight elements per row; five stacked expanded sections in the panel; colored verdict chips everywhere. The overload: nothing recedes. → all deltas\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"file://~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/apps/desk/.tmp/shots/root.png\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2\u003eSide by side — list anatomy\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"pair\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tag\"\u003eLinear\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg src=\"linear-docs-concepts.png\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"tag\"\u003eOurs\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg src=\"file://~/Coding/punt-labs/desk/apps/desk/.tmp/shots/root.png\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\n","file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/.tmp/ux-refs/teardown.html"},"tool_input_hash":"906b08d26cdd7caceff11614219ac5deeb810c2798b5ccc0e9d59fce859406df","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"\\u003c!DOCTYPE html\\u003e\\n\\u003chtml lang=\\\"en\\\"\\u003e\\u003chead\\u003e\\u003cmeta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"\\u003e\\u003ctitle\\u003eUX teardown — references vs desk\\u003c/title\\u003e\\n\\u003cstyle\\..."}
