{"ts":"2026-09-11T13:40:56.326770206Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"\u003crepo\u003e/.tmp/ux-refs/teardown.html","new_string":"\u003ch2\u003e2 · Linear — real issue detail (enlarged crop)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eOne dominant title, description prose, compact activity feed (system events muted, comments carded) — and ALL metadata in the quiet right rail: Properties (status, priority, assignee, cycle) + Labels, which carry the page's only color. → D3\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-detail-crop.png\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"\u003eSame view in context (full homepage frame):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-home.png\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e2b · Linear — issue editor surface (docs)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eTitle + description editing inline on the canvas; no metadata in the body. → D3 D6\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-docs-edit.png\"\u003e","old_string":"\u003ch2\u003e2 · Linear — real issue detail (homepage app frame)\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"cap\"\u003eOne dominant title, description prose, compact activity feed — and ALL metadata in the quiet right properties rail. → D3\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"linear-home.png\"\u003e","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"568120d35f4c08184168b4f186d10aacc4f68a3d3a778a5ebe727672c469f8e8","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"\\u003crepo\\u003e/.tmp/ux-refs/teardown.html\",\"new_string\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e2 · Linear — real issue detail (enlarged crop)\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp class=\\\"cap\\\"\\u003eOne dominant title, ..."}
