{"ts":"2026-09-12T01:37:46.815195542Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \u0026\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker edt --evaluator dna --write-set \"apps/desk/src/**\" --criteria \"Fix the macro layout and content model to match Linear literally (docs/ux-teardown-2026-09-11.md rulings still apply): full-width list; selecting a mission navigates to a FULL detail view (centered prose column ~720-760px max-width + right properties rail ~280px, Esc/breadcrumb back) — the permanent side peek panel is REMOVED. Row titles flex to fill available width and truncate only on real overflow (no fixed title column, no dead space). Content budgets: 2-line title cap w/ expand, ask excerpt ~6 lines w/ show-full, one-line activity entries, evidence collapsed past 4. Headline precedence context \u003e ticket \u003e trimmed criterion with collision discriminators. Show the WORKER delegation prompt (not evaluator). Normalize YAML literal-block newlines into paragraphs. Default view scoped to recent (last 14 days grouped by day) with All behind a click. tsc clean; screenshot-iterate vs linear-docs-concepts.png and linear-detail-crop.png; commit per step.\"","description":"Dispatch layout+content rebuild mission"},"tool_input_hash":"855073bdcac29e6df772acc9e3f4ddc772530afd13e2664abb98cd1aa87ebd03","tool_input_preview":"{\"command\":\"cd ~/Coding/punt-labs/desk \\u0026\\u0026 ethos mission dispatch --worker edt --evaluator dna --write-set \\\"apps/desk/src/**\\\" --criteria \\\"Fix the macro layout and content model to match Li..."}
