{"ts":"2026-09-12T01:41:25.741967596Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Amendment to m-2026-09-12-001, operator-directed …","message":"Amendment to m-2026-09-12-001, operator-directed — three changes to what I sent you:\n\n1. DISCLOSURE = EXACTLY TWO LEVELS (NN/g rule: \u003e2 levels loses users; frequency decides the split; ONE clearly-labeled door). Replace my multi-door spec:\n   - Level 1 = list row: status glyph · title · muted date · avatar. Nothing else. (Keep the tiny muted id only if Linear-parity demands it; it may go.)\n   - Level 2 = detail view: title, \"Ask\" excerpt (~6 lines), latest outcome (author, verdict glyph, 2-3 line prose excerpt), properties rail. That must cover 90% of visits and fit ~25-30 text lines above the fold with real whitespace.\n   - ONE door, bottom of the prose column, labeled \"Full record — rounds, evidence, timeline, mechanics\" → expands the complete history in place. NOT three separate collapsibles; delete \"Show earlier activity\" and the standalone Mechanics \u003cdetails\u003e as separate doors — they all live behind the one door.\n2. PIXEL FIDELITY to the reference wherever measurable: sample actual hex values and geometry from linear-docs-concepts.png / linear-detail-crop.png (ImageMagick `convert \u003cpng\u003e -crop 1x1+X+Y txt:` picks colors) — bg, row height ratio, title size ratio, rail width ratio, gap rhythm. Match numbers, don't approximate from taste.\n3. DENSITY BUDGET is a hard gate: before finishing, count visible text lines in your detail screenshot; if the default view exceeds ~30 lines of content text, cut until it doesn't. Whitespace is the deliverable.\n\nEverything else in my previous message stands (full-width list, navigate-don't-peek, flexing titles, headline precedence, worker-prompt fix, newline normalization, Recent scope). Same loop: grade every screenshot NEXT TO the reference.","recipient":"worker-redesign","summary":"Amendment: 2-level disclosure, pixel fidelity, density budget","to":"worker-redesign","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"903a3e01a0b02851778b955d6ed0906346c76a04f4ea0e064153ed9ad408b421","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Amendment to m-2026-09-12-001, operator-directed …\",\"message\":\"Amendment to m-2026-09-12-001, operator-directed — three changes to what I sent you:\\n\\n1. DISCLOSURE = EXACTLY TWO LEVEL..."}
