{"ts":"2026-09-12T02:07:26.049366559Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Round 2 on m-2026-09-12-001 — my two amendment me…","message":"Round 2 on m-2026-09-12-001 — my two amendment messages (sent mid-flight, check your inbox history) are binding and detail-loaded.png shows they're not in: the full criteria block renders unclamped (~35 dense lines) directly under the ask, blowing the ~30-line density gate, and the latest outcome is buried below it. Enforce now:\n\n1. Default detail view content, in order: title (2-line clamp) · ASK excerpt (~6 lines, as built) · LATEST OUTCOME (author, verdict glyph, 2-3 line prose excerpt) · then ONE door: \"Full record — criteria, rounds, evidence, timeline, mechanics\". Nothing else renders by default. The criteria dump, all rounds, evidence, timeline live INSIDE the opened Full record; within it, audit-type material (hashes, ids, evidence tables, timeline minutiae, mechanics) may sit behind a third collapse level (operator ruling). The rail's separate MECHANICS disclosure moves inside Full record too — one door total on the page.\n2. Density gate is a hard exit criterion: screenshot the default detail view and COUNT the content text lines; \u003e30 = keep cutting.\n3. Pixel sampling (amendment 2): sample bg/row/title/rail values from linear-detail-crop.png and note actual vs yours in the result.\nSubmit round-2 result with the before/after screenshots. Everything else you built stands — the skeleton is right.","recipient":"worker-redesign","summary":"Round 2: amendments not incorporated — enforce","to":"worker-redesign","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"faf6dd2db03175cb335c50c81e25bacef61d7e9779992c6309beca6cd07328b7","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Round 2 on m-2026-09-12-001 — my two amendment me…\",\"message\":\"Round 2 on m-2026-09-12-001 — my two amendment messages (sent mid-flight, check your inbox history) are binding and det..."}
