{"ts":"2026-09-12T13:05:04.256379894Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"SendMessage","tool_input":{"content":"Operator round from live use — four fixes, mechan…","message":"Operator round from live use — four fixes, mechanical, commit directly on spike/thin-slice under apps/desk/src/** (no new mission; report when done):\n\n1. DEFAULT SCOPE: \"Recent 14d\" lands on ONE row against the real store (newest activity Sep 1, rest July-). Change default to \"All\" (grouped by status as built); keep Recent as the secondary pill. Better: make Recent adaptive — most recent 30 missions by activity grouped by day — but default remains All either way.\n2. TIMEZONE BUG: group header says \"SEP 1\" while the row in it renders \"Sep 2\" — day bucketing uses UTC while row dates use local (or vice versa). Bucket and render in the same zone (local).\n3. EMPTY-STATE ADAPTATION (detail): a mission with no delegations/results (e.g. m-…-05-07-001, abandoned) currently shows two dashed \"not recorded\" placeholder boxes as the entire body. Instead: render only sections that have content; add ONE compact line where the body would be, e.g. \"Abandoned before any delegation — no ask or results recorded\", and if success_criteria exist show them (this is the one case where criteria earn default visibility, since there is nothing else).\n4. RAIL ADJACENCY: reference (linear-detail-crop.png) has the rail ADJACENT to the prose column; ours pins the rail to the window edge leaving a huge gulf at wide sizes. Make the detail content one centered block: prose column (max 760) + 24-32px gap + rail (300), centered together, rail never floats free.\n\nSame loop: screenshot next to reference, tsc clean, report with shots.","recipient":"worker-redesign","summary":"Fix round: defaults, tz bug, empty states, rail adjacency","to":"worker-redesign","type":"message"},"tool_input_hash":"df79230d5b7921f8cc59dcba1796d5a3d3c3a4f39a0b7ecd67337632470c128a","tool_input_preview":"{\"content\":\"Operator round from live use — four fixes, mechan…\",\"message\":\"Operator round from live use — four fixes, mechanical, commit directly on spike/thin-slice under apps/desk/src/** (no n..."}
