{"ts":"2026-09-13T16:03:23.305371676Z","session":"00f1ab56-8e0a-4c22-8f2c-ed8da8891ca9","tool":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"~/.claude/projects/-home-jfreeman-Coding-punt-labs-ethos/memory/desk-status-and-data-standard.md","new_string":"**Desk is a CLOSED spike as of 2026-09-13** (operator: \"it was a spike…\nwe do not need to keep it… do not delete the code… no long list of\ntodos\"). Code preserved for reference on `spike/thin-slice` in\n`~/Coding/punt-labs/desk`, unmerged, runtime stopped, no open workstream\nand no backlog. The takeaways live in `desk/LEARNINGS.md`.\n\nThe one successor thread the operator ruled: **revise the ethos data\nstandard to be human friendly** — revision list in\n`desk/docs/ethos-data-standard-findings.md` (title field, context\npromotion, criteria template hygiene, delegation role field, prose\nsummary contract, trace-log completeness, CLI JSON contracts). If a real\nworkspace GUI is ever built, start from `desk/PLAN.md` + LEARNINGS, not\nthe spike code.\n\n**How to apply:** don't reopen desk work or generate desk TODOs; treat\nthe data-standard design round (ethos repo) as the live thread when the\noperator raises it. Related: [[no-freelance-design]],\n[[desk-native-not-browser]], [[verification-requires-running]].","old_string":"As of 2026-09-13, the desk thin slice (repo `~/Coding/punt-labs/desk`,\nbranch `spike/thin-slice`, unmerged per operator rule) is live as a native\nTauri app: full-width Linear-pattern list, navigate-to-detail, two-level\ndisclosure (+L3 audit inside \"Full record\"), measured pixel values.\nOperator verdict: **\"reasonable but not great\"** — expects substantial\nfurther UX time, and ruled that **the ethos data standard must be revised\nto be human friendly**. The concrete revision list (title field, context\npromotion, criteria template hygiene, delegation role field, prose summary\ncontract, trace-log completeness, CLI JSON contracts) lives in\n`desk/docs/ethos-data-standard-findings.md`; UX rulings in\n`desk/docs/ux-teardown-2026-09-11.md` (D1–D12 + follow-ups).\n\n**How to apply:** the next major thread is an ethos-repo design round for\nthe data standard (future DES) using that findings doc as input; desk UX\nwork continues reference-anchored per [[no-freelance-design]], demos\nnative per [[desk-native-not-browser]], verification by running per\n[[verification-requires-running]].","replace_all":false},"tool_input_hash":"da4619b77458b952141b96f162b7dbb3c6aedc69f87b064b56ef1560e0bc0427","tool_input_preview":"{\"file_path\":\"~/.claude/projects/-home-jfreeman-Coding-punt-labs-ethos/memory/desk-status-and-data-standard.md\",\"new_string\":\"**Desk is a CLOSED spike as of 2026-09-13** (operator: \\\"it was a spike…..."}
